                h3 👋🏾 Hi, I'm Ollie.
                p I am a web developer and digital product specialist with over 15 years of experience building accessible, user-focused websites. My work sits at the intersection of software development, UX, and digital strategy, with a strong focus on clarity, performance, and long-term maintainability.
                p I’ve led frontend teams, collaborated closely with designers and stakeholders, and delivered robust digital platforms across the arts, public, and cultural sectors. From custom WordPress builds and system integrations to API-driven services, I focus on making complex systems simple and reliable.
